		(property "Description" "XFCN PCB soldering terminal with an M3 threaded side face and supplied screw/pressure washer; four THT legs, all one electrical node. The external daughterboard or conductor requires an M3 clearance hole and is clamped against the threaded face. Manufacturer states 40 A and 0.5 N*m thread torque. JLC Extended, THT manual/wave assembly. PCB hole pattern, screw-axis datum, washer envelope, and joint stack remain incoming-sample gates."
